<li>Added the new Connections page — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a></li>
