<li>Redesigned Settings — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added a redesigned Logs viewer — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a></li>
<li>Added responsive Sidebar and mobile navigation variants — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added platform-specific headers for Windows/macOS/Linux — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added directional route animations and shared AnimatedOutlet components — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added system accent-color integration — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4472951987" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/4632" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4632/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4632">#4632</a></li>
<li>Added an HCT theme color picker with live preview — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5683515748" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5561" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5561/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5561">#5561</a></li>
<li>Added Material Design color variables and new theme infrastructure — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added configurable window decorations — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added multi-window support — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3878997642" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/4030" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4030/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4030">#4030</a></li>
